§§ `הנספחים — טבלאות שבוע העבודה`

-- The work-week annexes the corpus publishes with this copy: annex א'
-- (att_1), the work week in a primary school, and annex ב' (att_2), in a
-- junior high school — each in three tables, up to age 50, from 50 and from
-- 55 (the last "not for new teachers from תשס"ח") — and the two tables §27(ח)
-- names as annexes ג' and ג1', for positions below a third: a junior high
-- school's (att_3), its hand-written letter read by the corpus as
-- illegible, and a primary school's (att_4), with no letter. The primary takes them as named inputs: `the hours annexes א
-- and ב give` (§27(ז), and §131(ג)'s Z), `the hours annexes ג and ג1 give`
-- (§27(ח)), `the part-time mother's week the annexes give` (§27(ט)) and
-- `the part-time age reduction the annexes give` (§27(יא)), all in
-- base-agreement-27; the functions below are what each would read.
--
-- A column of a table is a position and its hours; the rows are printed
-- across: "היקף משרה", "שעות הוראה פרונטאליות", "שעות פרטניות", "שעות שהייה",
-- "סה"כ שעות שבועיות", "שעות שהייה למורה אם בבי"ס אחד * (79% משרה ומעלה)."
-- and "שעות שהייה למורה אם המועסקת במספר בתי"ס **.". Each column below is
-- one printed column, its cells in that order; "לא רלוונטי" is NOTHING.
@desc One printed column of an annexed work-week table.
DECLARE `annexed week column` HAS
    `annexed position`             IS A NUMBER @desc "היקף משרה", as printed
    `annexed frontal hours`        IS A NUMBER
    `annexed individual hours`     IS A NUMBER
    `annexed stay hours`           IS A NUMBER
    `annexed weekly hours`         IS A NUMBER @desc "סה"כ שעות שבועיות", as printed
    `annexed mother's stay hours in one school`      IS A MAYBE NUMBER @desc NOTHING where the table prints "לא רלוונטי", or no such row
    `annexed mother's stay hours in several schools` IS A MAYBE NUMBER

GIVEN p IS A NUMBER, f IS A NUMBER, i IS A NUMBER, s IS A NUMBER, w IS A NUMBER
      `one school` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `several schools` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH AN `annexed week column`
DECIDE `an annexed column` p f i s w `one school` `several schools` IS
    `annexed week column` WITH
        `annexed position`         IS p
        `annexed frontal hours`    IS f
        `annexed individual hours` IS i
        `annexed stay hours`       IS s
        `annexed weekly hours`     IS w
        `annexed mother's stay hours in one school`      IS `one school`
        `annexed mother's stay hours in several schools` IS `several schools`

@desc The ages an annexed table is for, as its heading line prints them.
DECLARE `annexed table's ages` IS ONE OF
    `up to age 50`
    `from age 50`
    `from age 55`

@desc An annexed work-week table.
DECLARE `annexed week table` HAS
    `annexed table's title`   IS A STRING
    `annexed table's stage`   IS A `school stage`
    `annexed table's age`     IS AN `annexed table's ages`
    `annexed table's columns` IS A LIST OF `annexed week column`

-- Annex א' (att_1): its title, and the table "עד גיל 50".
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1/t1
`annex א up to age 50` MEANS
    `annexed week table` WITH
        `annexed table's title`   IS "טבלת שבוע עבודה, כולל שעות גיל והפחתת שעות שהייה למורה אם- יסודי"
        `annexed table's stage`   IS `a primary school`
        `annexed table's age`     IS `up to age 50`
        `annexed table's columns` IS LIST
