-- akn:attachments/p7 Copies: his senior deputy; no rule.
-- akn:attachments/p8 Copies: the head of the training administration; no rule.
-- akn:attachments/p9 Copies: the head of the personnel administration; no rule.
-- akn:attachments/p10 Copies: the head of the economics and budgets administration; no rule.
-- akn:attachments/p11 Copies: a senior division head of that administration; no rule.
-- akn:attachments/p12 Copies: the head of the teaching personnel division; no rule.
-- akn:attachments/p13 The Ministry's address; no rule.
-- akn:attachments/p14 The Ministry's web addresses; no rule.

§§ `עקרונות הפיתוח המקצועי במסגרת "אופק חדש"`

-- akn:att_10__hc_1/p1 The corpus's note on what the pages are: the document the letter of 25.12.2008 encloses, pages 69–74 of the scan; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1/p2 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1/p3 The heading "general"; its paragraphs follow.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1/p4 Why professional development is a condition of promotion: lifelong learning keeps teaching good and relevant; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1/p5 The document's purpose: to set out the principles for teachers, counsellors, principals and first deputies, and how the Ministry prepares to apply them; no rule.

-- p6 and paras 1–3: the document speaks to three populations, and its
-- parts א, ב and ג take them in turn.
@ref akn:att_10__hc_1/p6 akn:att_10__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_10__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_10__hc_1__para_3
DECLARE `population of the development principles` IS ONE OF
    `school principals`
    `first deputy principals`
    `teachers, kindergarten teachers and counsellors, second deputies and above among them`

-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_1 The heading of part א, the principals' professional development; its rules follow.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_2 The heading of א.I, the principal's role in Israel; its paragraphs follow.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_2/p1 The principal's central role, to lead the school educationally and pedagogically; a statement of the role conception, no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_2/p2 The four further fields of management that support it; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_2/p3 The first field, the school's vision and the management of change; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_2/p4 The second field, leading and developing the staff; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_2/p5 The third field, attention to the individual; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_2/p6 The fourth field, the school's ties with the community; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_2/p7 The principal sees the whole school and connects its fields; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_2/p8 The source of the role conception, the report of Avney Rosha's professional committee; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_3 The heading of א.II, the principles of the principals' professional development; its rules follow.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_4 The heading of part ב, the first deputies' professional development; its rules follow.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_5 The heading "principles" of part ב; its rules follow.

-- א.II and ב: the principals' development rests on the role conception and
-- the stage of development (א.II.1); a first deputy's is made together with
-- the principals', on the principals' fields, the management team taken as
-- one unit (ב.1). For both, the contents and frameworks are developed by
-- the Ministry and Avney Rosha, in coordination with the union (א.II.2,
-- ב.2); Avney Rosha operates them (א.II.3, ב.3); and the scope of studies
-- for promotion is set by the Ministry and the union together (א.II.4,
-- ב.4) — set elsewhere, no number here.
@ref akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_3__para_1 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_5__para_1
GIVEN p IS A `population of the development principles`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `develops with the principals, on the principals' fields` p IF
    p EQUALS `school principals` OR p EQUALS `first deputy principals`

@ref akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_3__para_2 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_3__para_3 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_5__para_2 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_5__para_3
DECLARE `development body` IS ONE OF
    `the Ministry and Avney Rosha, in coordination with the teachers' union`
    `Avney Rosha, the institute for school leadership`

`who develops the principals' and first deputies' contents and frameworks` MEANS
    `the Ministry and Avney Rosha, in coordination with the teachers' union`
`who operates the principals' and first deputies' development` MEANS
    `Avney Rosha, the institute for school leadership`

@ref akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_3__para_4 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_5__para_4
`why the principals' and first deputies' study hours are not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "משרד החינוך והסתדרות המורים, במשותף (א.II.4, ב.4)"

-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_6 The heading of part ג, the professional development of teachers, kindergarten teachers and counsellors; its paragraphs follow.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_6/p1 What professional development is: the lifelong growth of a teaching employee's knowledge and skills; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_6/p2 It runs on a continuum, from training through induction and the career; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_7 The heading of ג.I, the basic assumptions; its paragraphs follow.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_7__para_1 A basic assumption: the teaching employee is a professional; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_7__para_2 A basic assumption: what educational knowledge rests on; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_7__para_3 A basic assumption: personal growth is part of professional development; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_7__para_4 A basic assumption: the professional, his superior and the supervision are responsible for his development; no rule of its own (the duties are IV's, below).
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_7__para_5 A basic assumption: the frameworks are in the classroom, the fields of knowledge and the roles beside them; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_7__para_6 A basic assumption: every teaching employee may be a homeroom teacher besides teaching his fields; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_8 The heading of ג.II, the goals of professional development; its paragraphs follow.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_8__para_1 A goal: a professional identity; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_8__para_2 A goal: personal and professional capability; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_8__para_3 A goal: commitment to good teaching, learning and assessment; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_8__para_4 A goal: the teaching employee as a member of the school's team; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_8__para_5 A goal: personal development with an educational world view; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_8__para_6 A goal: better answers to pupils, parents and partners; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_8__para_7 A goal: mobility up the professional grades; no rule of its own (the grades and their hours are V's, below).
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_8__para_8 A goal: carrying the Ministry's policy; no rule.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_9 The heading of ג.III, the principles of the outline; its paragraphs follow.

-- ג.III: the fields and content units of "the map of professional
-- development" are built by the subject the teaching employee teaches, his
-- main role, his stage on the career continuum and the fields of
-- development; counsellors get units for their social and emotional work,
-- and kindergarten teachers units for early childhood (para 5) — the
-- adaptation of the criteria to a counsellor that the primary's §130 names.
@ref akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_9/p1 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_9__para_1 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_9__para_2 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_9__para_3 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_9__para_4
DECLARE `what the development map is built by` IS ONE OF
    `the subject the teaching employee teaches`
    `his main role`
    `his stage on the career continuum`
    `the fields of development: the subject, the didactic and educational, the managerial`

`the development map is built by` MEANS LIST
    `the subject the teaching employee teaches`, `his main role`, `his stage on the career continuum`,
    `the fields of development: the subject, the didactic and educational, the managerial`

@ref akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_9__para_5
GIVEN `a counsellor` IS A BOOLEAN, `a kindergarten teacher` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the content units fitted to` `a counsellor` `a kindergarten teacher` IS
    BRANCH IF `a counsellor` THEN "יחידות תוכן שרלוונטיות לעבודת היועץ החינוכי בתחום החברתי והנפשי"
           IF `a kindergarten teacher` THEN "יחידות התוכן שרלוונטיות לעבודתם בגיל הרך"
           OTHERWISE "יחידות התוכן של מפת הפיתוח המקצועי"

-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_10 The heading of ג.IV, the frameworks of action; its lines follow.
-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_11 The heading of the principal's role in the development of his school's teaching employees; its duties follow.

-- ג.IV, and the principal's role under it: each level's part. The
-- headquarters sets the policy, the contents, the means of operation and
-- the budget; the district forms and carries out a district plan through
-- the Pisga centres, the colleges of education and the universities; the
-- school prepares a three-year plan for its teaching staff, approved by the
-- supervisor — the principal's school plan, for each employee and for the
-- school (hc_11 para 1) — and the principal talks with each teaching
-- employee about his development on a three-year view (para 2), manages the
-- carrying out, application and control (para 3; IV's last line,
-- "יישום מעקב ובקרה") and the assimilation and evaluation (para 4); the
-- teaching employee prepares a personal three-year plan and brings it into
-- his class, with the principal. No line sets a time.
@ref akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_10/p1 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_10/p2 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_10/p3 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_10/p4 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_10/p5 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_10/p6 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_10/p7 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_10/p8 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_10/p9 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_11__para_1 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_11__para_2 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_11__para_3 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_11__para_4
DECLARE `professional-development duty` IS ONE OF
    `set the development policy, contents, means of operation and budget`
    `form and carry out a district development plan through the Pisga centres, the colleges of education and the universities`
    `prepare the school's three-year development plan for each teaching employee and for the school, with the supervisor's approval`
    `hold a personal talk with each teaching employee about his development, on a three-year view`
    `manage the carrying out, application and control of development in the school`
    `manage the assimilation and evaluation of development in the school`
    `prepare a personal three-year development plan and bring it into the class, with the principal`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `professional-development duty`
DECIDE `the professional-development duties of each level` IS
    (PARTY `the Ministry of Education` MUST `set the development policy, contents, means of operation and budget`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the Ministry of Education` MUST `form and carry out a district development plan through the Pisga centres, the colleges of education and the universities`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the school principal` MUST `prepare the school's three-year development plan for each teaching employee and for the school, with the supervisor's approval`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the school principal` MUST `hold a personal talk with each teaching employee about his development, on a three-year view`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the school principal` MUST `manage the carrying out, application and control of development in the school`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the school principal` MUST `manage the assimilation and evaluation of development in the school`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teaching employee` MUST `prepare a personal three-year development plan and bring it into the class, with the principal`)

-- akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_12 The heading of ג.V, the scope of studies for professional development; its rules follow.

-- V.א(1): in grades 1–6 a teaching employee studies 60 hours a year toward
-- promotion: 120 hours to rise to grade 2 or 3, 180 to rise to grade 4, 5
-- or 6 — the years §38(ב) asks in the grade below, at 60 hours each
-- (asserted below). V.ב: for grades 7–9 the scope is formed by the Ministry
-- with the union — set elsewhere.
@ref akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_12__para_a akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_12__para_a__subpara_1
`the yearly professional-development hours` MEANS 60

GIVEN `to grade` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the development hours for promotion to` `to grade` IS
    BRANCH IF `to grade` AT LEAST 2 AND `to grade` AT MOST 3 THEN JUST 120
           IF `to grade` AT LEAST 4 AND `to grade` AT MOST 6 THEN JUST 180
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

@ref akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_12__para_b akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_12__para_b__subpara_1
`why grades 7 to 9 ask no hours here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "משרד החינוך בתיאום עם הסתדרות המורים (V.ב.1)"

-- V.א(2): a non-academic with 28 years of seniority or more who does not
-- complete a degree studies 75 hours a year, to 300 hours for each of
-- grades 2–6 — the primary's §58(1) four years in a grade, at 75 hours
-- each (asserted below).
@ref akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_12__para_a__subpara_2
`a senior non-academic's yearly development hours` MEANS 75

GIVEN `to grade` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `a senior non-academic's development hours for promotion to` `to grade` IS
    IF `to grade` AT LEAST 2 AND `to grade` AT MOST 6 THEN JUST 300 ELSE NOTHING

-- V.א(3)–(6): what counts. Only courses and hours the training department
-- recognised as professional development for promotion under the reform
-- ((3), its "במגרת" a corpus sic, taken as given); institutional in-service
-- training does not count ((4)); in a sabbatical year up to 180 hours,
-- which count toward promotion ((5)); a teacher under the reform who
-- completes a second degree is recognised, on the day of his entitlement
-- to it, at most 120 hours in all of the hours promotion asks ((6)).
@desc A course or block of hours a teaching employee studied, as far as V.א(3)–(5) ask.
DECLARE `development study` HAS
    `the study's hours`                      IS A NUMBER
    `recognised by the training department`  IS A BOOLEAN @desc recognised by the training, in-service and guidance department for professional development under the reform
    `institutional in-service training`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `studied in a sabbatical year`           IS A BOOLEAN

`the most hours a sabbatical year counts` MEANS 180
`the most hours a second degree counts` MEANS 120

@ref akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_12__para_a__subpara_3 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_12__para_a__subpara_4 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_12__para_a__subpara_5 akn:att_10__hc_1__hc_12__para_a__subpara_6
GIVEN s IS A `development study`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the study counts` s IF
    s's `recognised by the training department` AND (NOT s's `institutional in-service training`)

GIVEN studies IS A LIST OF `development study`
      `a second degree completed under the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
      `hours the promotion asks` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the development hours counted` studies `a second degree completed under the reform` `hours the promotion asks` IS
    min `the most hours a sabbatical year counts` (sum (map (GIVEN s YIELD s's `the study's hours`) (filter (GIVEN s YIELD `the study counts` s AND s's `studied in a sabbatical year`) studies)))
    PLUS sum (map (GIVEN s YIELD s's `the study's hours`) (filter (GIVEN s YIELD `the study counts` s AND NOT s's `studied in a sabbatical year`) studies))
    PLUS (IF `a second degree completed under the reform` THEN min `the most hours a second degree counts` `hours the promotion asks` ELSE 0)

GIVEN `to grade` IS A NUMBER
      studies IS A LIST OF `development study`
      `a second degree completed under the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has the development hours for promotion to` `to grade` studies `a second degree completed under the reform` IF
    CONSIDER `the development hours for promotion to` `to grade`
    WHEN JUST h THEN `the development hours counted` studies `a second degree completed under the reform` h AT LEAST h
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

-- The hours beside the primary: §38(ב)'s years in the grade below at 60
-- hours a year, and §58(1)'s four years at 75.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD `the development hours for promotion to` g EQUALS JUST (`the yearly professional-development hours` TIMES `years in the grade below for promotion to` g)) (range 2 6)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD `a senior non-academic's development hours for promotion to` g EQUALS JUST (`a senior non-academic's yearly development hours` TIMES `years in a grade for a senior non-academic`)) (range 2 6)
#ASSERT `the development hours for promotion to` 7 EQUALS NOTHING

GIVEN h IS A NUMBER, `recognised` IS A BOOLEAN, `institutional` IS A BOOLEAN, `in a sabbatical year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `development study`
DECIDE `a study of` h `recognised` `institutional` `in a sabbatical year` IS
    `development study` WITH
        `the study's hours`                     IS h
        `recognised by the training department` IS `recognised`
        `institutional in-service training`     IS `institutional`
        `studied in a sabbatical year`          IS `in a sabbatical year`

-- 60 recognised hours and 60 of institutional training are not 120; a
-- sabbatical year's 200 hours count 180; a second degree covers grade 3's
-- 120 hours and 120 of grade 4's 180.
#ASSERT NOT `has the development hours for promotion to` 2 (LIST `a study of` 60 TRUE FALSE FALSE, `a study of` 60 TRUE TRUE FALSE) FALSE
#ASSERT `has the development hours for promotion to` 2 (LIST `a study of` 60 TRUE FALSE FALSE, `a study of` 60 TRUE FALSE FALSE) FALSE
#ASSERT `the development hours counted` (LIST `a study of` 200 TRUE FALSE TRUE) FALSE 180 EQUALS 180
#ASSERT `has the development hours for promotion to` 3 EMPTY TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `has the development hours for promotion to` 4 EMPTY TRUE
#ASSERT `has the development hours for promotion to` 4 (LIST `a study of` 60 TRUE FALSE FALSE) TRUE

§§ `נספח ח' — העסקת עובדי הוראה שאינם אקדמאים עפ"י תנאי "אופק חדש"`

-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p1 The letterhead: the State of Israel; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p2 The letterhead: the Ministry of Education; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p3 The letterhead: the personnel administration; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p4 The letterhead: the senior division for teaching personnel; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p5 The letterhead: the division head's office; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p6 The letter's Hebrew date, the day of p7; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p7 The letter's date, 25 December 2008, the day the agreement was signed; no rule of its own.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p8 The reference number; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p9 The address: "to"; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p10 The addressees: school principals; their duties are p18–p19.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p11 The greeting; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p12 The subject line: employing non-academic teaching employees on Ofek Hadash terms; the rules are p13–p19.

-- The letter to principals that sends out annex ח', which the primary's
-- §51(א) asks a non-academic teacher to sign. p13: a non-academic with 1 to
-- 27 years of seniority for pay may be employed on the reform's terms if
-- he signs an undertaking to complete an academic degree; p14: he is asked
-- to sign the form to move; p15: once signed, the agreement's terms for
-- non-academics who complete their education apply; p17: one with up to 27
-- years who does not sign stays on the terms in force on the eve of the
-- agreement, as they change from time to time — §51(א)(1)–(2). p16: one
-- with 28 years or more is employed on the reform's terms without
-- signing, and "as they complete their education to an academic degree as
-- aforesaid" his pay and terms are the academic teacher's. The letter
-- states no time for that degree; §51(ב)(2) gives §§59(א) and 60 for one
-- completed within 4 years of the reform in his school and (ב)(3) leaves a
-- later one to part מט. The "כאמור" is read as the agreement's, so the
-- letter adds nothing to §51(ב) (convention reading.referral).
@ref akn:att_11__hc_1/p13 akn:att_11__hc_1/p14 akn:att_11__hc_1/p15 akn:att_11__hc_1/p16 akn:att_11__hc_1/p17
GIVEN `seniority for pay` IS A NUMBER, `signed annex ח'` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employed on the reform's terms by the letter on annex ח'` `seniority for pay` `signed annex ח'` IF
        `seniority for pay` AT LEAST 28
    OR (`seniority for pay` AT LEAST 1 AND `signed annex ח'`)

-- p18–p19: the principal passes the form to the non-academic teaching
-- employees of his school with up to 27 years of seniority for pay
-- (inclusive) and has them sign it; then gathers the forms and sends them
-- to the head of the district's teaching-personnel branch, with a copy to
-- the district treasury. No time is set.
@ref akn:att_11__hc_1/p18 akn:att_11__hc_1/p19
GIVEN `seniority for pay` IS A NUMBER, `holds an academic degree` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is to be given annex ח'` `seniority for pay` `holds an academic degree` IF
    (NOT `holds an academic degree`) AND `seniority for pay` AT MOST 27

@ref akn:att_11__hc_1/p18 akn:att_11__hc_1/p19
DECLARE `annex ח' duty` IS ONE OF
    `pass annex ח' to the non-academic teaching employees with up to 27 years of seniority for pay, and have them sign it`
    `gather the signed forms and send them to the district's teaching-personnel branch head, copied to the district treasury`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `annex ח' duty`
DECIDE `the principal's duties under the letter on annex ח'` IS
    PARTY `the school principal` MUST `pass annex ח' to the non-academic teaching employees with up to 27 years of seniority for pay, and have them sign it`
    HENCE PARTY `the school principal` MUST `gather the signed forms and send them to the district's teaching-personnel branch head, copied to the district treasury`

#ASSERT `employed on the reform's terms by the letter on annex ח'` 12 TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `employed on the reform's terms by the letter on annex ח'` 27 FALSE
#ASSERT `employed on the reform's terms by the letter on annex ח'` 28 FALSE
-- The letter beside §51: who is on the reform's terms, by seniority and
-- signature, is the same.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN s YIELD
                    `employed on the reform's terms by the letter on annex ח'` s TRUE
                EQUALS NOT (`the non-academic's terms` s TRUE NOTHING EQUALS `the existing terms, off the reform`))
            (range 1 40)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN s YIELD
                    `employed on the reform's terms by the letter on annex ח'` s FALSE
                EQUALS NOT (`the non-academic's terms` s FALSE NOTHING EQUALS `the existing terms, off the reform`))
            (range 1 40)
#ASSERT `is to be given annex ח'` 27 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `is to be given annex ח'` 28 FALSE

-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p20 The division's address; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p21 The Ministry's web addresses; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p22 The hand-written "נספח ח'" over the form; the form is annex ח' of §51(א), no rule of its own.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p23 The form's letterhead: the State of Israel; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p24 The form's letterhead: the Ministry of Education; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p25 The form's letterhead: the personnel administration; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p26 The form's letterhead: the senior division for teaching personnel; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p27 A blank for the date; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p28 The form's address: "to"; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p29 Addressee: the school's principal, a blank for the school; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p30 Addressee: the district's teaching-personnel branch head, to whom p19 sends the forms; no rule of its own.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p31 Addressee: the district treasurer, a blank; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p32 The form's title: declaration, consent and undertaking to complete an academic degree, for a teaching employee without one in a school applying the reform; its parts follow.

-- The form's blanks: the employee's personal details, his placement, and
-- the details of his school. They carry no rule; they are what the form
-- asks.
@ref akn:att_11__hc_1/t1 akn:att_11__hc_1/p33 akn:att_11__hc_1/p34 akn:att_11__hc_1/p35 akn:att_11__hc_1/p36 akn:att_11__hc_1/p37 akn:att_11__hc_1/p38 akn:att_11__hc_1/p39 akn:att_11__hc_1/p40 akn:att_11__hc_1/p41 akn:att_11__hc_1/p42 akn:att_11__hc_1/p43
`the details annex ח' asks` MEANS LIST
    "שם פרטי", "שם משפחה", "מספר זהות", "כתובת למשלוח דואר", "טלפון בבית", "טלפון נייד", "כתובת דואר אלקטרוני",
    "תאריך כניסת ביה\"ס בו הנני מועסק לרפורמה", "תעודת הוראה (יש/אין)", "מקצוע ההכשרה", "מקצוע ההוראה", "בכיתות", "היקף משרה בשנת כניסת עו\"ה לרפורמה",
    "המחוז", "ישוב", "שם המוסד", "סמל המוסד", "כתובת", "טלפון/פקס", "שם המפקח הכולל", "שם מפקח מקצועי", "סוג בי\"ס (יסודי/חט\"ב)", "ממלכתי/ממלכתי דתי"

-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p44 The division's address; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p45 The Ministry's web addresses; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p46 The letterhead of the form's second page: the State of Israel; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p47 The letterhead: the Ministry of Education; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p48 The letterhead: the personnel administration; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p49 The letterhead: the senior division for teaching personnel; no rule.

-- p50: the undertaking — to complete the academic studies and bring proof
-- of entitlement to a degree within 4 years of signing, the 4 years of
-- §51(א). p51: one who does so within 4 years of the reform in his school
-- is owed arrears under the agreement, back to the day he signed — the
-- condition of §59 ¶1; and the day he signs is the day he moves to the
-- reform's terms (§51(א)(1)), so its conversion, from which §59(א) counts
-- the months. p55: on signing, the reform's terms of employment apply to
-- him.
@ref akn:att_11__hc_1/p50 akn:att_11__hc_1/p51 akn:att_11__hc_1/p55
`the years annex ח' gives to complete the degree` MEANS 4

GIVEN `years from signing to the degree` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `keeps the undertaking of annex ח'` `years from signing to the degree` IF
    `years from signing to the degree` AT MOST `the years annex ח' gives to complete the degree`

GIVEN `years from the reform in the school to the degree` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `owed arrears by annex ח'` `years from the reform in the school to the degree` IF
    `years from the reform in the school to the degree` AT MOST 4

#ASSERT `the years annex ח' gives to complete the degree` EQUALS `years to complete the degree`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN y YIELD `owed arrears by annex ח'` y EQUALS `owed the arrears of section 59` y) (LIST 1, 3.5, 4, 4.5, 6)

-- p52–p54 (the form's "*"): the degree is one of a recognised institution
-- in Israel the Council for Higher Education recognised; or one of a
-- recognised institution abroad, approved as equivalent by the Ministry's
-- unit for the evaluation of foreign degrees; or studies entitling to a pay
-- grade equal to an academic one, approved by the teaching personnel
-- division or its district branches.
@ref akn:att_11__hc_1/p52 akn:att_11__hc_1/p53 akn:att_11__hc_1/p54
DECLARE `ground of a degree under annex ח'` IS ONE OF
    `a degree of a recognised institution in Israel, recognised by the Council for Higher Education`
    `a degree of a recognised institution abroad, approved as equivalent by the unit for the evaluation of foreign degrees`
    `studies entitling to a pay grade equal to an academic one, approved by the teaching personnel division or its district branches`
    `no such degree`

GIVEN g IS A `ground of a degree under annex ח'`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a degree for annex ח'` g IF
    NOT g EQUALS `no such degree`

-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p56 The form's closing formula, "in witness whereof"; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/t2 The blanks for the date and the signature; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p57 The division's address; no rule.
-- akn:att_11__hc_1/p58 The Ministry's web addresses; no rule.

§§ `הנספחים — טבלאות ההמרה של המורים שאינם אקדמאים`

