    `the whole row labelled` `this copy's annex י"ח` level

GIVEN t IS A `non-academic principals' table`
GIVETH AN `annexed pay table`
DECIDE `this copy's non-academic principals' table for` t IS
    CONSIDER t
    WHEN `the senior certified principals' table (annex י"ד)` THEN `this copy's annex י"ד`
    WHEN `the certified principals' table (annex ט"ו)` THEN `this copy's annex ט"ו`
    WHEN `the uncertified principals' table (annex ט"ז)` THEN `this copy's annex ט"ז`

GIVEN t IS A `non-academic principals' table`, level IS A NUMBER, grade IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `annexes י"ד to ט"ז as this copy prints them` t level grade IS
    `the annexed pay at` (`this copy's non-academic principals' table for` t) level grade

GIVEN t IS A `non-academic first deputies' table`
GIVETH AN `annexed pay table`
DECIDE `this copy's non-academic first deputies' table for` t IS
    CONSIDER t
    WHEN `the senior certified first deputies' table (annex י"ט)` THEN `this copy's annex י"ט`
    WHEN `the certified first deputies' table (annex כ')` THEN `this copy's annex כ'`
    WHEN `the uncertified first deputies' table (annex כ"א)` THEN `this copy's annex כ"א`

GIVEN t IS A `non-academic first deputies' table`, level IS A NUMBER, grade IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `annexes י"ט to כ"א as this copy prints them` t level grade IS
    `the annexed pay at` (`this copy's non-academic first deputies' table for` t) level grade

