-- §155's exhaustion, and §156's industrial peace, which reaches only what
-- the agreement settles and not §155(ב)–(ד). Its five matters (p11–p15).
@ref akn:att_25__hc_1/p10 akn:att_25__hc_1/p11 akn:att_25__hc_1/p12 akn:att_25__hc_1/p13 akn:att_25__hc_1/p14 akn:att_25__hc_1/p15
