    `an agreement on an organisational handling fee for the teaching employees the union represents`
    `negotiating the retirement terms of State teaching employees, by the retirement quotas for תשס"ט`
    `further talks on the erosion supplement and the jubilee grant for those on sabbatical when the erosion supplement was paid`
    `examining the union's request to apply the individual hour in the colleges of teacher education`

`the matters of the union's letter of 25.12.08` MEANS LIST
    `signing an amended יוח"א agreement, whose economic principles were already agreed`,
    `an agreement on an organisational handling fee for the teaching employees the union represents`,
    `negotiating the retirement terms of State teaching employees, by the retirement quotas for תשס"ט`,
    `further talks on the erosion supplement and the jubilee grant for those on sabbatical when the erosion supplement was paid`,
    `examining the union's request to apply the individual hour in the colleges of teacher education`

GIVEN m IS A `matter of the union's letter of 25.12.08`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is outside the exhaustion of claims by the union's letter` m IF
    elem m `the matters of the union's letter of 25.12.08`

#ASSERT all `is outside the exhaustion of claims by the union's letter` `the matters of the union's letter of 25.12.08`
